 at 60","rationale":"Between flat and Classic."},{"id":"high","label":"Like Classic (×2 at 60)","value":"Rage per hit ×2 at 60","rationale":"Close to Classic at 60."}],"defaultSetting":"expected","expectedSetting":"expected","status":"live","sens":[{"build":"warrior__arms","name":"Arms","setting":"high","pct":2.38,"dps":22.7},{"build":"warrior__arms_dragonkin","name":"Arms · vs Dragonkin","setting":"high","pct":2.25,"dps":22.3},{"build":"warrior__fury","name":"Fury","setting":"high","pct":3.12,"dps":33.2},{"build":"warrior__fury_2h","name":"Fury 2H","setting":"high","pct":3.39,"dps":32.1},{"build":"warrior__arms","name":"Arms","setting":"low","pct":-4.75,"dps":-45.3},{"build":"warrior__arms_dragonkin","name":"Arms · vs Dragonkin","setting":"low","pct":-4.57,"dps":-45.3},{"build":"warrior__fury","name":"Fury","setting":"low","pct":-7.78,"dps":-82.9},{"build":"warrior__fury_2h","name":"Fury 2H","setting":"low","pct":-6.2,"dps":-58.6}]},{"order":15,"class":"Warrior","key":"warr_rage_oh","label":"Do off-hand hits give full Rage?","short":"Same Rage as a main-hand hit of the same speed? Not measured yet.","description":"Blizzard said nothing about the off hand. TBC's similar formula gave it half.","source":"Blizzard's Priest & Warrior deep dive (no off-hand rule).","builds":["warrior__fury"],"settings":[{"id":"low","label":"Half (like TBC)","value":"off-hand Rage ×0.5","rationale":"TBC's formula."},{"id":"expected","label":"Full","value":"off-hand Rage ×1.0","rationale":"No penalty stated."}],"defaultSetting":"expected","expectedSetting":"expected","status":"live","sens":[{"build":"warrior__fury","name":"Fury","setting":"low","pct":-8.34,"dps":-88.8}]},{"order":16,"class":"Warrior","key":"warr_crit_rage","label":"Extra Rage from critical white hits","short":"Blizzard said 75%, then 100% the same day.","description":"Blizzard said 75%, then 100% the same day. No beta log has checked it.","source":"Blizzard's warrior notes, 1 October (two passes).","builds":["warrior__fury