":"every pet hits like a 2.0s pet","rationale":"Seen on the beta."}],"defaultSetting":"expected","expectedSetting":"expected","status":"live","sens":[{"build":"hunter__beast-mastery","name":"Beast Mastery","setting":"high","pct":6.09,"dps":58},{"build":"hunter__marksmanship","name":"Marksmanship","setting":"high","pct":3.21,"dps":32.7}]},{"order":20,"class":"Hunter","key":"hunter_tsa_hm_rank","label":"Trueshot Aura and Hunter's Mark at 60","short":"Both top ranks are weaker than the rank before. Assumed fixed.","description":"The client's top ranks are weaker than the rank before. If not fixed, a hunter casts the older rank.","source":"Forever client 70338 (Trueshot Aura 30 / 40 / 50 / 75 / 50, Hunter's Mark 26 / 59 / 98 / 71).","builds":["hunter__lone-wolf","hunter__marksmanship","hunter__beast-mastery"],"settings":[{"id":"low","label":"Top ranks as written","value":"Trueshot Aura +50, Hunter's Mark +71 attack power","rationale":"Only the top ranks usable."},{"id":"mid","label":"Best older rank","value":"Trueshot Aura +75, Hunter's Mark +98 attack power","rationale":"Cast the older rank."},{"id":"expected","label":"Top ranks fixed","value":"Trueshot Aura +100, Hunter's Mark +140 attack power","rationale":"Fixed onto the curve."}],"defaultSetting":"expected","expectedSetting":"expected","status":"live","sens":[{"build":"hunter__beast-mastery","name":"Beast Mastery","setting":"low","pct":-2.56,"dps":-24.4},{"build":"hunter__lone-wolf","name":"Lone Wolf","setting":"low","pct":-3.1,"dps":-33},{"build":"hunter__marksmanship","name":"Marksmanship","setting":"low","pct":-2.79,"dps":-28.5},{"build":"hunter__beast-mastery","name":"Beast Mastery","setting":"mid","pct":-1.44,"dps":-13.7},{"build":"hunter__lone-wolf","name":"Lone Wolf","setting":"mid","pct":-1.74,"dps":-18.6},{"build":"hunter__marksmanship","name":"Marksmanship","setting":"mid","pct":-1.57,"dps":-16}]},{"order":21,"class":"Hunter","key":"hunter_crit_per_agi","label":"Hunter crit per Agility at 60","short":"Lev